        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Take the First Few Seconds of a Bed\n\nGenerates a short music bed and cuts a sting from its opening. Slicing an existing track costs less than generating a new one when you need only a few seconds.\n\n**How it works:** \"Generate bed\" composes 8 seconds of music from a prompt for a bright synth arpeggio. \"First 3 s\" keeps the audio from 0 to 3 seconds, and \"Sting\" returns it.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"Generate bed\", then set start to 2 and end to 4 on \"First 3 s\" to take the sting from the middle instead."
        },
